	(text "Each LED: anode on its column wire, cathode on its row wire. Reference = D<column 1-31><row 01-60>,\ne.g. D1207 = column 11 (C11), row 06 (R06). Layout: LEDs at -45 deg, pitch 1.75 mm; rows on F.Cu, columns on B.Cu,\nrow lanes on In2 (top half to the top band, bottom half to the bottom band), In1 = GND plane."
